ulture, communication, and politics. It examines all aspects of culture that communicate through visual means, including 20th-century visual technologies-photography, cinema, video, etc., and their historical corollaries. The production and consumption of images, objects, and events is studied in diverse cultures. Students develop the critical skills necessary to appreciate how the approaches that define visual studies complicate traditional models of defining and analyzing art objects.", "catalogBreadth": null, "catalogDistr": null, "catalogEnrollmentPriority": "", "catalogLang": null, "catalogForbiddenOverlaps": null, "catalogAttribute": null, "catalogWhenOffered": null, "catalogComments": null, "catalogPrereqCoreq": null, "catalogPrereq": "", "catalogCoreq": "", "catalogFee": null, "catalogSatisfiesReq": null, "catalogPermission": null, "catalogCourseSubfield": null, "catalogOutcomes": null, "acadCareer": "UG", "acadGroup": "AS", "catalogName": null, "catalogNextOffered": null, "lastTermsOffered": "2026SP, 2026WI, 2025SP, 2024SP", "catalogCredits": null, "catalogGradeOption": null, "catalogLocation": null, "catalogCrosslisted": null, "catalogCrosslistings": null, "catalogComeets": null, "exploreCriteriaIds": []}, {"strm": 2944, "crseId": 370853, "crseOfferNbr": 2, "subject": "AMST", "catalogNbr": "2371", "titleShort": "Global Hip Hop", "titleLong": "Planet Rap: Where Hip Hop Came From and Where It's Going", "crseAttrs": [{"crseAttr": "0012", "crseAttrValue": "CA-AG", "descr": "AG-Cultural Analysis", "descrformal": "AG-Cultural Analysis", "attrDescr": "Distribution Requirements", "attrDescrShort": "DistReq"}, {"crseAttr": "0012", "crseAttrValue": "D-AG", "descr": "AG-Human Diversity", "descrformal": "AG-Human Diversity", "attrDescr": "Distribution Requirements", "attrDescrShort": "DistReq"}, {"crseAttr": "0012", "crseAttrValue": "LA-AG", "descr": "AG-Literature & the Arts", "descrformal": "AG-Literature and the Arts", "attrDescr": "Distribution Requirements", "att